 "intro_zh": "法门寺文化景区，又名“真身宝塔”。法门寺被誉为皇家寺庙，因安置释迦牟尼佛指骨舍利而成为举国仰望的佛教圣地，被誉为“护国真身宝塔”。法门寺由地宫、山门广场、佛光大道、法门寺寺院、合十舍利塔，和众多雕塑组成。",
 "intro_en": "Baoji (simplified Chinese: 宝鸡; traditional Chinese: 谿行市; pinyin: Bǎojī; Mandarin pronunciation: [pàʊ.tɕí] ) is a prefecture-level city in western Shaanxi province, People's Republic of China. Since the early 1990s, Baoji has been the second largest city in Shaanxi.",
 "intro_en_source": "wikipedia",
